<section class="cs-section">
  <h2 class="cs-section-title">Reflection</h2>
  <div class="cs-section-body">
    <p>This was a fun exercise in re-imagining how a cycling tour site I visit regularly could better serve its visitors. The biggest takeaway was how a few structural changes to filters — cascading dropdowns, a range slider, and a horizontal layout — can meaningfully reduce friction in a search-heavy experience without sacrificing any functionality.</p>
